# Thin Adapters
RULE: Adapters <100 lines. Delegate to UCS, UMI, UCI, UEI. No business logic in adapters.
WHY: Keeps adapters maintainable; logic belongs in engines/libraries.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/thin-adapters-pattern.md, 05-infrastructure/unified-libraries/
DO: Use get_storage_client, @handle_api_errors, get_venue_config, log_event; keep adapter <50 lines
NEVER: Put validation/transformation in adapter; exceed 100 lines; duplicate library logic
